uage}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{Accept}_M(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}nonacceptance\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{Accept}_M(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ill-formed machine codes are excluded. For a valid code, membership asserts nonacceptance, which includes both rejection and divergence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)$ (machine acceptance, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}nonacceptance\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}:\nM\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{Accept}_M(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E})\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1753,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance|Diagonal Nonacceptance Language]]"},{"id":"2caf5daca8cda484","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_{\\mathsf{diag},\\mathcal E}$ (diagonal nonacceptance language, see [[73-df-binary-diagonal-nonacceptance]])"}],"outgoing":["db96cabedd089e5f","888d8ab66ec7efca"]}